        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep within the archaic halls of a forgotten temple lies the secret to restoring a lost world. Guided only by ancient mechanisms, you'll journey through a crumbling ruin where nature, technology, and myth intertwine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light of the Ancients</strong> is a calm, first-person puzzle adventure focused on environmental storytelling and laser-based challenges. Each puzzle is a self-contained door to the next — simple in concept, satisfying in execution. You'll manipulate beams of light, reflect them through mysterious devices, and unlock ancient pathways as you move deeper into the temple's heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short, single-player experience designed to be approachable and immersive, ideal for players who enjoy quiet, thoughtful gameplay without pressure or combat. The temple holds its secrets — it's up to you to bring its story back into the light!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep within the archaic halls of a forgotten temple lies the secret to restoring a lost world. Guided only by ancient mechanisms, you'll journey through a crumbling ruin where nature, technology, and myth intertwine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light of the Ancients</strong> is a calm, first-person puzzle adventure focused on environmental storytelling and laser-based challenges. Each puzzle is a self-contained door to the next — simple in concept, satisfying in execution. You'll manipulate beams of light, reflect them through mysterious devices, and unlock ancient pathways as you move deeper into the temple's heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short, single-player experience designed to be approachable and immersive, ideal for players who enjoy quiet, thoughtful gameplay without pressure or combat. The temple holds its secrets — it's up to you to bring its story back into the light!</p>",
